{"slug": "surface-area-calculator", "title": "Surface Area Calculator", "h1": "Surface Area Calculator", "category": "math", "categoryTitle": "Math Calculators", "description": "This calculator computes the surface area of a number of common shapes, including sphere, cone, cube, cylinder, capsule, cap, conical frustum, and more.", "html": "<div id=\"breadcrumbs\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/BreadcrumbList\"><span itemprop=\"itemListElement\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/ListItem\"><a href=\"/index\" itemprop=\"item\"><span itemprop=\"name\">home</span></a><meta content=\"1\" itemprop=\"position\"/></span> / <span itemprop=\"itemListElement\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/ListItem\"><a href=\"/math-calculator\" itemprop=\"item\"><span itemprop=\"name\">math</span></a><meta content=\"2\" itemprop=\"position\"/></span> / <span itemprop=\"itemListElement\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/ListItem\"><a href=\"/surface-area-calculator\" itemprop=\"item\"><span itemprop=\"name\">surface area calculator</span></a><meta content=\"3\" itemprop=\"position\"/></span></div> <h1>Surface Area Calculator</h1>\n<p>Use the calculators below to calculate the surface area of several common shapes.</p>\n<a name=\"ball\"></a>\n<h2>Ball Surface Area</h2>\n<table><tr><td>\n<form action=\"surface-area-calculator.html#ball\" name=\"calform\">\n<table class=\"panel\">\n<tr>\n<td align=\"right\">Radius (r)</td><td> <input class=\"inhalf\" id=\"ballradius\" name=\"ballradius\" type=\"text\" value=\"\"/>\n<select name=\"ballradiusunit\">\n<option value=\"miles\">miles</option>\n<option value=\"yards\">yards</option>\n<option selected=\"\" value=\"feet\">feet</option>\n<option value=\"inches\">inches</option>\n<option value=\"kilometers\">kilometers</option>\n<option value=\"meters\">meters</option>\n<option value=\"centimeters\">centimeters</option>\n<option value=\"millimeters\">millimeters</option>\n<option value=\"micrometers\">micrometers</option>\n<option value=\"nanometers\">nanometers</option>\n<option value=\"angstroms\">angstroms</option>\n</select>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-top:8px;\">\n<input name=\"ballcal\" type=\"submit\" value=\"Calculate\"/>\n<input onclick=\"clearForm(document.calform);\" type=\"button\" value=\"Clear\"/>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n</form>\n</td><td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\"><img alt=\"ball\" height=\"82\" src=\"/img/surface-area/ball.svg\" width=\"82\"/></td></tr></table>\n<a name=\"cone\"></a>\n<br/><h2>Cone Surface Area</h2>\n<table><tr><td>\n<form action=\"surface-area-calculator.html#cone\" name=\"calform2\">\n<table class=\"panel\">\n<tr>\n<td align=\"right\">Base Radius (r)</td><td> <input class=\"inhalf\" id=\"coneradius\" name=\"coneradius\" type=\"text\" value=\"\"/>\n<select name=\"coneradiusunit\">\n<option value=\"miles\">miles</option>\n<option value=\"yards\">yards</option>\n<option selected=\"\" value=\"feet\">feet</option>\n<option value=\"inches\">inches</option>\n<option value=\"kilometers\">kilometers</option>\n<option value=\"meters\">meters</option>\n<option value=\"centimeters\">centimeters</option>\n<option value=\"millimeters\">millimeters</option>\n<option value=\"micrometers\">micrometers</option>\n<option value=\"nanometers\">nanometers</option>\n<option value=\"angstroms\">angstroms</option>\n</select>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"right\">Height (h)</td><td> <input class=\"inhalf\" id=\"coneheight\" name=\"coneheight\" type=\"text\" value=\"\"/>\n<select name=\"coneheightunit\">\n<option value=\"miles\">miles</option>\n<option value=\"yards\">yards</option>\n<option selected=\"\" value=\"feet\">feet</option>\n<option value=\"inches\">inches</option>\n<option value=\"kilometers\">kilometers</option>\n<option value=\"meters\">meters</option>\n<option value=\"centimeters\">centimeters</option>\n<option value=\"millimeters\">millimeters</option>\n<option value=\"micrometers\">micromete